WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:05.030
Peace. I love this word peace,
especially this concept

2
00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:07.750
of biblical peace from
the Old Testament.

3
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:11.110
The Hebrew word here is shalom.

4
00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:13.590
And shalom doesn't
just mean peace.

5
00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:16.550
That's one of the challenges that
we have as we try to translate

6
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:20.950
the Bible: we take some of these
rich textured words and we just

7
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.750
translate them into a
single word or idea.

8
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:27.510
And really, the idea that's
being communicated here is not

9
00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.530
peace, as in the absence

10
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:34.930
of conflict; it's things
exactly as they should be.

11
00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:40.590
It's a richness, it's a fullness,
and it's a flourishing

12
00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:45.410
of life. And so today,
my prayer is not that

13
00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:50.050
God would give you the
absence of conflict, it's that

14
00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:52.370
he would give you his shalom.

15
00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:55.700
Thank you for joining me
in this workout today.

16
00:00:55.750 --> 00:01:00.500
If I can pray for you in any
specific way, please, please send

17
00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:01.860
me a prayer request.

18
00:01:01.910 --> 00:01:04.580
I love to do it. I can't wait
to see you on the next workout.

19
00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:06.020
Let me close our time.

20
00:01:06.070 --> 00:01:08.270
Lord, we thank you
for the blessings.

21
00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:13.720
God, the blessings that encourage
us, Lord, the blessings,

22
00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:17.000
Lord, that preserve us and
just help us to continue to

23
00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:21.640
persevere. And Lord, today
we just receive this blessing

24
00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:26.040
of shalom. And we recognize,
Lord, that through your grace, you

25
00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:30.200
lead us to spaces and you lead
us to places where there is more

26
00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:33.160
richness and fullness
and flourishing of life.

27
00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:36.120
And Lord, that doesn't
come without an exchange.

28
00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:39.160
It doesn't mean that we just
get to walk into these places

29
00:01:39.210 --> 00:01:42.970
exactly as we are with no
concern and just kind of do

30
00:01:43.050 --> 00:01:46.120
whatever it is that we want to do.
No, we recognize, Lord, that

31
00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:51.480
to experience more of your
shalom, more of your peace,

32
00:01:51.530 --> 00:01:55.240
that there are things in our
life that need to continue to

33
00:01:55.290 --> 00:02:00.120
change. And thank you that it is
your grace that leads us there.

34
00:02:00.170 --> 00:02:02.100
In Jesus' name, amen.

